The next unit is deliberately narrow and evidence-backed:

- add unconditional `LocallyOfFiniteType` and `QuasiCompact` instances for the exact glued carrier from its finite affine open cover;
- add immersion-based orbit/stable-cover consumers so projectivity is no longer the artificial front-door requirement;
- keep the existing projective API as a compatibility wrapper.

These do not claim the missing global immersion or representability theorem, but they turn the remaining gate into its exact mathematical certificate and strengthen the carrier without touching the base-change lane.

